  date: 
  title: Daily Facts
  pages:
  - heading: Transport
    facts:
    - 'Harbor shuttle: evening departures rise from 12 to 18, starting November 2.
      Service manager: Mira Chen.'
    - 'Transit route survey: 200 residents surveyed, 60 in favour (30 percent).'
  - heading: Culture and community
    facts:
    - 'Riverside Museum: first public day is November 14. November 7 is a staff-only
      rehearsal. Director: Elena Park.'
    - 'Westbank Repair Cafe: 45 of 60 appliances repaired in October (75 percent).
      Next public session: November 8. Coordinator: Jules Morgan.'
